&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;金融商品取引法第24条の５第４項及び企業内容等の開示に関する内閣府令第&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;19条第２項第８号の２&lt;/span&gt;(子会社取得の決定)の規定に基づく&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;2024年３月14日&lt;br/&gt;東海財務局長に提出。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherReferenceInformationTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h1 class="smt_head1"&gt;第二部 【提出会社の保証会社等の情報】&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock>
